{
  "$comment": "EXP-1341/NEW-1: THE display title of ANY session (root, child or agent; never `Session N`), ONE reference ×4 (TS packages/domain-contract/src/session-title.ts, desktop `domain::session_title`, iOS ExpCore `SessionTitle.swift`, Android `domain/SessionTitle.kt`; the server's `deriveSessionTitle` and `listSessions` call the TS one). sessionTitle(session, links, issues, messages) = the FIRST rung that yields text, every value trimmed: (1) the explicit name: `title` (a name passed to `sessions_send`, else the agent CLI's own auto-title, written once by `sessions.report` into a blank title; both live in `title`, so an explicit name always wins); (2) the session's OWN issues: every `session_issues` row with `sessionId == id` (NEW-1: a row sits on the session that holds the issue, root or child alike; a root's chat strip shows the union over its tree, its title only its own rows), ordered by `sortOrder` then `issueId`, resolved through `issues` (unknown ids skipped): one = `titles.issue`, several = `titles.issues` with {more} = n-1; when the label is longer than `titleMax` characters the {title} part alone is cut to fit and ends in `…`; (3) the first prompt: that session's messages with `card == null` that are a person's (`authorKind == user`) or another session's input (`authorSessionId` set and != the session's id), oldest first (`createdAt`, then `id`), the first whose body has a usable line: the first line that, with every composer image marker `[Image #<digits>]` (EXP-698; bodies keep them, session-chat.json draws them as chips) removed (each run of markers, with the spaces and tabs around it, becomes ONE space) and the line trimmed again, is non-blank and does not start with `![` (an image embed); a line of only markers is not usable (the next line is tried, then the next message); longer than `titleMax` characters = cut to titleMax-1, trailing whitespace trimmed, `…` appended; (4) `untitled`.",
  "titles": {
    "issue": "#{identifier} {title}",
    "issues": "#{identifier} {title} + {more}"
  },
  "titleMax": 80,
  "untitled": "Untitled",
  "cases": [
